> Andries zaps a platinum wand!  The bolt of fire whizzes by you!  The
bolt of fire bounces!  The bolt of fire bounces!

Hey, who did that?  Well, let's see…

> ;
> H	a giant humanoid (storm giant called Andries) [seen: normal vision,
infravision]

Didn't know that random monsters other than ghosts or corpses could get
named.  A quick grep at the source code reveals "Andries" as one of the
names random ghosts receive, period.  Polymorphed?  Well, how did he get
the wand of fire then?  I don't have conflict and don't usually leave
that kind of toys lying around.  Nethack is full of surprises.

On a humorous side note, Andries Brouwer is the author of Hack 1.0.
Quite a giant indeed, and the storm he unleashed is still raging today…

